        "title": "The Lantern Foundry",
        "author": "Lantern Trails",
        "description": "Power parcels connect wells, receiver windows and crossings. Deliver one at a time, revisit sources and let charged receivers change the road.",
        "intro": "The finale: an amber receiver needs two deliveries before M1 chooses Powered. Hold two jade plates with a crate and yourself for the repeated upper crossing. Then dispatch three more colours through tubes and prisms. Pip rings the first bell; you answer Home. One rewrite; eight flags.",
        "ending": "The last parcel lights the whole foundry. Rook opens its empty workshop to anyone with a plan. Pip rests its hands on the table while Tavi turns your map over. There is room on the other side for somebody else’s adventure.",
        "hint": "Push the crate west onto jade, then stand on the other jade plate. Apply East / East / Use and advance seventy-eight cards. Pip makes two laps, powers M1 and completes every delivery. Go around the crate, ring Home near column 9, restore the far light and return. The parcel crossings stay powered.",
